     "totalMs": 2227,
     "chars": 176
    }
   ],
   "replyText": "Nice, Sarah — that's a correct sentence. Now let's use that pattern about yourself. The card shows \"On Friday, I...\" Can you finish it with something you actually do on Friday?"
